Optimal Solution - Sort the array and pair smallest and largest elements to minimize the maximum pair sum.

class Solution {
    public int minPairSum(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int ans = 0;
        // Sort the array
        Arrays.sort(nums);
        // Pair smallest with largest using two pointers
        int i = 0, j = n - 1;
        while (i < j) {
            // Update maximum pair sum
            ans = Math.max(ans, nums[i] + nums[j]);
            i++;
            j--;
        }
        return ans;
    }
}

Time Complexity :- O(n log n).
Space Complexity :- O(1).
